---
/**
 * Representative sample content for the Stage 1 design-direction preview.
 * Rendered inside a `data-theme` wrapper so each direction restyles it via tokens.
 */
---

<div class="sample">
  <a class="badge" href="#">CARs 700.28 · retrieved 2026-01-15</a>
  <h3>Maximum Flight Duty Period</h3>
  <p>
    Your maximum flight duty period depends on the time your FDP starts, how many flights you are
    scheduled for, and the average length of those flights. If you are not acclimatized to local
    time, a more restrictive limit applies.
  </p>
  <p class="muted">
    Applies to 703, 704 and 705 operations · in force since 12 December 2020 (705).
  </p>

  <table>
    <caption>Maximum FDP — acclimatized, average flight length 30–50 min (CARs 700.28(3))</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr
        ><th scope="col">FDP start</th><th scope="col">1–7 flights</th><th scope="col">8–11</th><th
          scope="col">12+</th
        ></tr
      >
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">07:00–12:59</th><td>13:00</td><td>12:00</td><td>11:00</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">13:00–16:59</th><td>12:30</td><td>11:30</td><td>10:30</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">17:00–21:59</th><td>11:00</td><td>10:00</td><td>9:00</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="calc">
    <div class="calc__bar">FDP calculator</div>
    <div class="calc__body">
      <div class="calc__row"><span>Report time</span><span>06:30</span></div>
      <div class="calc__row"><span>Number of flights</span><span>6</span></div>
      <div class="calc__row"><span>Average flight length</span><span>30–50 min</span></div>
      <div class="calc__row"><span>Acclimatized</span><span>Yes</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="calc__out">
      Maximum FDP <strong>13:00</strong> — CARs 700.28(3), row 07:00–12:59
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step">
    <span>Are hours of work extended beyond the maximum FDP?</span>
    <span class="step__yn"><span>Yes</span><span>No</span></span>
  </div>

  <p class="disc">
    Educational aid, not legal advice. Verify against the current CARs and your company Operations
    Manual.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .sample {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .sample h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .sample p {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .muted {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }
  table {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }
  caption {
    text-align: left;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  th,
  td {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  thead th {
    background: var(--bg-sunk);
  }
  .calc {
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 34rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    background: var(--bg-raised);
  }
  .calc__bar {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
  }
  .calc__body {
    padding: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .calc__row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .calc__row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .calc__out {
    background: var(--bg-sunk);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .calc__out strong {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0.6rem 0;
  }
  .step__yn {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }
  .step__yn span {
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
  }
  .disc {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--warn-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--warn-border);
    color: var(--warn-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
</style>
